#: ../../source/06-case-study.rst:3 c8c9f72537bd46d4b306a272f32da2cb
msgid "Case study: a 206-file course, 38 GB to 14"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/06-case-study.rst:10 876c6cce94324ab588f2e2cb6954d987
msgid "The core ideas"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/06-case-study.rst:12 90b53b37bc2e432f8b6f8fcb6cc7260b
msgid ""
"**Real numbers, one real library.** A 206-lesson screen-recording video "
"course (IT-certification training), **37.75 GB** of 1080p H.264, re-encoded"
" to H.265 and verified end to end."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/06-case-study.rst:14 1c32879ee7ba47dba49adafc8ac015f2
#, python-format
msgid ""
"**~64% smaller, zero visible loss.** The result was **13.71 GB** — the "
"same picture, a third of the bytes — confirmed both by eye and by "
":term:`VMAF`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/06-case-study.rst:16 2591ffa190bf44589801f665bbb1a8cf
msgid ""
"**The encoder was chosen with data.** A :doc:`benchmark <02-commands>` on"
" one representative lesson picked Intel :term:`QSV` over CPU x265: near-"
"identical quality, ~2× faster, and entirely on the idle iGPU."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/06-case-study.rst:19 7dd769f557254838983ab68947f2b995
msgid ""
"**Nothing was deleted on faith.** Every one of the 206 outputs was full-"
"decoded and length-checked before any source was considered removable — "
"**206/206 SAFE-TO-DELETE, 0 errors.**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/06-case-study.rst:23 f0abf2b6232441d383ff0fe563d7bd5e
