#: ../../source/06-case-study.rst:172 899cf067124f4b1098725b7bae66dfff
msgid "What this demonstrates"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/06-case-study.rst:174 7f50516b8bf5465fbf4f7c38f426ccfa
msgid ""
"The job exercised the whole tool in order — ``analyze`` and ``check`` to "
"see what was on disk, ``benchmark`` to choose the encoder on real "
"footage, ``encode`` to convert, and ``verify`` to make deletion safe — "
"and it is the reason slimv has the shape it does. Every command in "
":doc:`02-commands` earned its place on a real library: the size win came "
"from the right :term:`profile`, the confidence came from VMAF plus a "
"full-decode pass, and the safety came from never trusting a build's "
"\"success\" message over an actual decode."
msgstr ""

